  "openapi": "3.1.0",
  "info": {
    "title": "casefile",
    "description": "The core's API (Bauplan \u00a74). JSON in, JSON out; the surface is static files served beside it (ADR-014).\n\nEvery request leaves one audit line in `<root>/_audit/api.jsonl`. Identity is a signed cookie naming a\nperson from people.json; how it is obtained depends on the deployment (open in development and in the\ndemo sandbox, a login later). The core recovers half-done steps on start and records manual moves on read.\n",
    "version": "0.1.0"
  },
